---
title: "_createVesting (LegionVestingManager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: _verifyValidVestingConfig(investorVestingConfig)
    q_validate --> q_revert_start: vestingStartTime > block.timestamp + 10 years
    q_revert_start --> [*]: revert LegionVesting__InvalidVestingStartTime()
    q_validate --> q_revert_duration: vestingDuration > 10 years OR vestingDuration == 0
    q_revert_duration --> [*]: revert LegionVesting__InvalidVestingDuration()
    q_validate --> q_revert_cliff: cliffDurationSeconds > vestingDuration
    q_revert_cliff --> [*]: revert LegionVesting__InvalidCliffDuration()
    q_validate --> q_revert_tge: tokenAllocationOnTGERate > DENOMINATOR
    q_revert_tge --> [*]: revert LegionVesting__InvalidTGEAllocationRate()
    q_validate --> q_check_type: valid config
    q_check_type --> q_linear: vestingType == LINEAR
    q_linear --> q_deploy_linear: factory.createLinearVesting(msg.sender, controller, startTime, duration, cliffDuration, askToken)
    q_deploy_linear --> [*]: return vestingAddress
    q_check_type --> q_epoch: vestingType == LINEAR_EPOCH
    q_epoch --> q_revert_epoch: epochDuration * numberOfEpochs != vestingDuration
    q_revert_epoch --> [*]: revert LegionVesting__InvalidEpochConfig()
    q_epoch --> q_deploy_epoch: factory.createLinearEpochVesting(msg.sender, controller, startTime, duration, cliffDuration, epochDuration, askToken)
    q_deploy_epoch --> [*]: return vestingAddress

    note right of q_check_type
        INV-001: vesting start time within 10 years from now
        INV-002: cliff duration cannot exceed vesting duration
        INV-003: for epoch vesting: epochDuration * numberOfEpochs == vestingDuration
        INV-004: TGE allocation rate capped at 100% (DENOMINATOR)
        INV-005: vesting contracts deployed via factory (clone pattern)
    end note
